  "bodyHash": "4ay+7wlLfN4=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bbLz3Kt.png\" alt=\"區塊載入器橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1046\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>區塊載入器</strong>讓你可以透過<strong>不同等級的區塊載入器</strong>來保持區塊持續載入！你可以透過<strong>地圖</strong>載入<strong>單個區塊</strong>，而區塊載入器最多可載入<strong>7x7區域</strong>。由區塊載入器載入的區塊也會接收到<strong>隨機刻</strong>，因此<strong>農作物、甘蔗和樹木</strong><strong>會持續生長</strong>。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>內容：</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/B9XRirQ.png\" alt=\"基本區塊載入器\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;基本區塊載入器</strong></h4><p>- 可載入3x3區域的區塊</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/313/2/310/172/basic_chunk_loader_recipe.png\" alt=\"基本區塊載入器合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KzUhLER.png\" alt=\"單一區塊載入器\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;單一區塊載入器</strong></h4><p>- 可載入單個區塊</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/313/3/310/172/single_chunk_loader_recipe.png\" alt=\"單一區塊載入器合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/dC3MJEZ.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/dC3MJEZ.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/N9f6uAy.png\" alt=\"進階區塊載入器\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;進階區塊載入器</strong></h4><p>- 可載入5x5區域的區塊</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/313/4/310/172/advanced_chunk_loader_recipe.png\" alt=\"進階區塊載入器合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u9PuZy9.png\" alt=\"終極區塊載入器\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;終極區塊載入器</strong></h4><p>- 可載入7x7區域的區塊</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/313/5/310/172/ultimate_chunk_loader_recipe.png\" alt=\"終極區塊載入器合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qj1EJve.gif\" alt=\"橫幅\" width=\"932\" height=\"265\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>逐步指南：</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>載入與卸載區塊</strong></h4><h5>1. 放置一個區塊載入器</h5><h5>2. 右鍵點擊區塊載入器以開啟其地圖</h5><h5>3. 點擊區塊以切換載入或卸載狀態</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TrNzcVX.gif\" alt=\"終極區塊載入器的地圖\" width=\"534\" height=\"295\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>常見問題</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>區塊載入器會在我載入世界時自動載入區塊嗎？</strong></h4><h5>是的，區塊載入器會在您載入世界時自動載入區塊</h5><h4><strong>已載入的區塊會收到隨機刻嗎？</strong></h4><h5>是的，已載入的區塊也會收到隨機刻，因此農作物、甘蔗和樹木會持續生長</h5><h4><strong>為什麼我放置了區塊載入器後生物還是沒有生成？</strong></h4><h5>生物只會在玩家周圍生成，而不僅僅是在區塊載入時。如果您希望生物生成，可以使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scarecrows-territory/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">稻草人領地</a>模組。</h5><h4><strong>我可以在我的模組包中使用您的模組嗎？</strong></h4><h5>是的，歡迎在我的模組包中使用我的模組</h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3><h5>歡迎加入SuperMartijn642的Discord伺服器，以獲取未來內容、即將推出的模組及討論資訊！</h5><h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Pq75bNE.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"36\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qj1EJve.gif\" alt=\"橫幅\" width=\"932\" height=\"265\"></p>",
